      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "Room-temperature χMT = 21.96 cm3 K mol−1. χMT decreases on cooling then rises at low T, indicating depopulation of EuIII excited states and ferromagnetic Co···Co interactions. Field-induced SMM behaviour: frequency-dependent χ′′ under zero dc field without a maximum, and a frequency-dependent χ′ maximum under 2 kOe dc field. Ueff = 16.4 K (ln(χ′′/χ′) vs 1/T).",
